<title>USA: PHLX to list Flores &amp; Rucks options Feb 11.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list Flores &amp; Rucks options Feb 11.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Thursday it would begin trading options on shares of Flores &amp; Rucks Inc on Feb 11.</p>
<p>The options would have opening strike prices of 45, 50 and 55, with initial expirations in March, April, June and September. Position limits of 4,500 contracts have been set.</p>
<p>TFM Investment Group was named the specialist unit for the options.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
